{"ID":"20240118151124-claa3nq","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151124-claa3nq","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151124-claa3nq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151124-w8aosy3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122132140-9ye0idv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122132140-9ye0idv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:215,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:219\u0026#125;","title":"201蜀羊泉","type":"doc","updated":"20240201133827"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151124-w8aosy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151124-w8aosy3","updated":"20240122132121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，微寒，无毒。治头秃，恶疮，热气，疥瘙，痂廯虫，龋齿。生川谷，又名羊泉。全草可用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132126-ruvh1qo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132126-ruvh1qo"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132133-dedxidh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132133-dedxidh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性寒， "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132134-xc1v5xk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132134-xc1v5xk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】为杀虫灭菌药，治疗疥廯，白秃，漆疮及蛀齿。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132135-1ra1f0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132135-1ra1f0y"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】女子阴中内伤。皮间积实。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132137-dn127ve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132137-dn127ve"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏敬】主小儿惊，生毛发，捣涂漆疮。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132138-v5ylvlq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132138-v5ylvlq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般二至四钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132139-suijf95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132139-suijf95"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】多外用，少内服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132121-7n0rsmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132121-7n0rsmi"}},{"ID":"20240122132140-l1yhh7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132140-l1yhh7r"}},{"ID":"20240122132140-9ye0idv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132140-9ye0idv","updated":"20240201133827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"全草可用。21叫蜀羊泉，又名叫羊泉。这个倒是蛮普遍的。很多地方可以，外面的疥疮，皮肤上的疥疮，生那个虫，都可以使用。那个虱子啊什么啊。这个羊泉呢，是杀虫灭菌的药。过去呢羊泉，我们把那个整个干的蜀羊泉拿来火一烧，那个烟薰一下，能够杀身上的虱子啊，还有床被褥的跳蚤之类的东西哈，都可以杀，啊。治疗疥癣，外用的疥癣。大部分都是外用，没有人拿来吃的。很少人拿来吃的，都是外用。还有我要提醒，诸位如果你到市面上去看，你可以去买那个药物词典里面，有彩色药，彩色照片的，可以买那个来。那个都对的，可以去看，不会有人那么白目，编还编错，那个都对的，草木类的。"}]}]}